SUMMARY:Studio Walk-In Office Hour
DESCRIPTION:Studio is the heart of the Cornell Tech experience. At roughly 
 a quarter of your coursework\, it's where you'll take on real problems for
  real companies\, build products\, and learn what it takes to launch a ven
 ture in a fast-moving\, entrepreneurial environment. A little prep over th
 e summer will help you start strong in the fall.\n\nTo get you ready\, we'
 re hosting a Studio Summer Office Hour on July 17 from 12:00pm-12:50pm in 
 Tata 141. Stop by with your questions about what Studio is and how to make
  the most of it.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://cornelltech.campusgroups.c
 om/rsvp?id=2132916\n\nAudience: JCTMBA'27
LOCATION:See event page for location
CATEGORIES:School events
URL:https://cornelltech.campusgroups.com/rsvp?id=2132916
END:VEVENT
