BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tech-events:field-conditions-incubating-media-arts-in-nyc@ctsg.tech.cor
 nell.edu
DTSTAMP:20260930T212604Z
DTSTART:20260930T230000Z
DTEND:20261001T003000Z
SUMMARY:Field Conditions: Incubating Media Arts in NYC
DESCRIPTION:New York’s art / design / technology field is held together b
 y a coalition between practices and cultural institutions that shape what 
 gets made\, who gets supported\, and what survives. This panel brings toge
 ther NEW INC at the New Museum\, Rhizome\, and Onassis ONX\, New York City
  institutions that have an ongoing commitment to Art\, Design and Technolo
 gy. The conversation will look at how each organization identifies and sup
 ports practitioners\, where funding and institutional models are heading\,
  and what is actually emerging in practice right now. For anyone working a
 cross computational design\, interaction\, immersive media\, and creative 
 technology\, it offers a direct view of the infrastructure behind the work
  and of what it takes to build a practice in this city.\n\nAudience: Alumn
 i\, Faculty\, International Students\, Master's Students\, PhDs\, Postdocs
 \, Prospective Students\, Public\, Roosevelt Island Community
LOCATION:Gensler Family AAP NYC Center\, Tata Innovation Center\, Cornell T
 ech 11 East Loop Road\, 4th Floor New York\, NY 10044
CATEGORIES:Cornell Tech events
URL:https://tech.cornell.edu/events/field-conditions-incubating-media-arts-
 in-nyc/
END:VEVENT
