BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tech-events:revolutionizing-healthcare-with-ai-powered-devices@ctsg.tec
 h.cornell.edu
DTSTAMP:20260930T212604Z
DTSTART:20261008T160000Z
DTEND:20261008T180000Z
SUMMARY:Revolutionizing Healthcare With AI-Powered Devices
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join the Weill Cornell Medicine community fo
 r a showcase of digital health innovations and technologies. This event is
  part of #AIWeekNY\, a community-led festival organized by Pulse NYC that 
 celebrates innovation across the AI ecosystem. The following innovators an
 d their AI-enabled technologies will be featured: EmulatRx An agentic AI p
 latform that uses real-world patient data to support clinical trial design
 . Presented by Weishen Pan\, PhD\, Research Associate\, Department of Popu
 lation Health Sciences\, Weill Cornell Medicine WAV AI An AI-based tool th
 at analyzes sounds to detect fistula stenosis. Presented by Bobak Mosadegh
 \, PhD\, Associate Professor of Biomedical Engineering in Radiology and Di
 rector\, Dalio Institute of Cardiovascular Imaging\, Weill Cornell Medicin
 e Postpartum Depression Risk Prediction An Epic-integrated clinical decisi
 on support tool that analyzes electronic health record data to identify pr
 egnant patients at elevated risk for postpartum depression. Presented by Y
 iye Zhang\, PhD\, MS\, Associate Professor of Population Health Sciences\,
  Weill Cornell Medicine Corneal Confocal Microscopy for Neurodegenerative 
 Disease Detection A noninvasive approach that uses corneal confocal micros
 copy to detect changes in the cornea’s small nerve fibers. Quantitative 
 imaging and predictive analysis may offer an accessible biomarker for dete
 cting and monitoring neurodegeneration. Presented by Rayaz A. Malik\, MBCh
 B\, PhD\, FRCP\, Professor of Medicine\, Weill Cornell Medicine–Qatar We
  look forward to seeing you there!\n\nAudience: Alumni\, Faculty\, Interna
 tional Students\, Master's Students\, PhDs\, Postdocs
LOCATION:1300 York Ave\, New York\, NY
CATEGORIES:Cornell Tech events
URL:https://tech.cornell.edu/events/revolutionizing-healthcare-with-ai-powe
 red-devices/
END:VEVENT
